## Journey: Review a N244 application validation failure

This is a separate, unimplemented review. Entering an N244 is [Enter a general application](#journey-enter-a-general-application), which starts from the Case details **Next step** dropdown.

Caseworker opens a case with an N244 application validation failure, uses **Next steps** on an assigned task, completes the review event, then returns to Case details.

